  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Holy Roller\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Holy-roller.png\" title=\"Image:Holy-roller.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Holy-roller.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Holy-roller.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Skill Type: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Offensive\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Trainer: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Fighter\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Number of Ranks: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">17\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Cost to Max: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Unknown\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Charge enemy, deal Divine damage, slow target, chance to knock down\n</td></tr></table>\n<p>A magical attack, where the player charges the enemy and unleashes a powerful blast dealing Divine Damage, which slows the target down and has a chance to knock them down.<br/>\nThis skill requires a melee weapon.\n</p><p><b>Cool down:</b> weapon based.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><b>X Divine Damage. Slows target by 25% for 5 seconds.</b><br/>* Damage listed is at INT = 10 for comparison purposes.  Damage increase is 1.5 damage points / point of Intellect.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<table align=\"right\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center; width:100%; background:rgb(240,240,240);\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" wid